@prefix : <https://www.kairosflow.ai/ont/accelerator/logistics#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

<https://www.kairosflow.ai/ont/accelerator/logistics> a owl:Ontology ;
    dcterms:title "Kairos Logistics Accelerator Pack" ;
    dcterms:description """Pre-composed ontology bundle for logistics companies.
    
    Includes all logistics-relevant ontologies:
    - DCSA (container shipping, demurrage & detention)
    - MMT (multi-modal transport)
    - BSP (buy-ship-pay: commercial, financial, cost accounting, revenue & yield)
    - TIC (terminal operations)
    - IMO (maritime regulatory)
    - WCO (customs & border)
    - Sustainability (carbon & energy)
    - RAIL (TAF TSI — EU rail freight reservation & running)

    Plus one blueprint-tier module — the ONLY non-standards-derived content in this pack:
    - Blueprint / Transport Order (Kairos-authored; closes the demand-side order grain that the
      standards audit in issue #29 proved no installed standard expresses). Kept as a separate
      import so consumers can see exactly which classes carry no standard provenance.

    Does NOT include FIBO (use Financial Services Accelerator for capital-markets ontologies).
    Does NOT bulk-import IATA ONE Record (air cargo) — the authoritative mirror is vendored
    under authoritative-ontologies/IATA/ and exposed via the catalog; bind it hub-local at the
    reservation grain per the multimodal-order-leg pattern, the same way FIBO is excluded.""" ;
    dcterms:creator "Kairos Ontology Team" ;
    dcterms:created "2026-05-16"^^xsd:date ;
    dcterms:modified "2026-08-15"^^xsd:date ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.10.1" ;
    owl:imports <https://www.kairosflow.ai/ont/blueprint/transport-order> ,
                <https://www.kairosflow.ai/ont/dcsa> ,
                <https://www.kairosflow.ai/ont/dcsa/demurrage-detention> ,
                <https://www.kairosflow.ai/ont/mmt> ,
                <https://www.kairosflow.ai/ont/bsp> ,
                <https://www.kairosflow.ai/ont/tic> ,
                <https://www.kairosflow.ai/ont/imo> ,
                <https://www.kairosflow.ai/ont/wco> ,
                <https://www.kairosflow.ai/ont/sustainability> ,
                <https://www.kairosflow.ai/ont/supply-chain> ,
                <https://www.kairosflow.ai/ont/rail> .
